Third-party code
----------------

The PCL3GUI driver (app/src/main/java/com/example/myprinter/usb/Pcl3GuiDriver.kt)
and the Mode 10 compressor (app/src/main/java/com/example/myprinter/usb/Mode10Compressor.kt)
are Kotlin ports of parts of HPLIP (HP Linux Imaging and Printing) 3.23.12,
files prnt/hpcups/Pcl3Gui2.cpp, Encapsulator.cpp, PrinterCommands.h and Mode10.cpp.
Source: https://developers.hp.com/hp-linux-imaging-and-printing

